# Origin of the MAHA-GR-ALIGN API. Leave EMPTY for local development (Vite proxies /api to
# uvicorn) and for the bundled build that FastAPI serves itself.
#
# Set it only for a split deployment — static frontend on one host, Python API on another.
# It must be an https:// origin: a page served over HTTPS cannot call http://localhost, and
# browsers differ on whether they make an exception for it. Use a tunnel:
#
#   cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8000
#
# and paste the https://<generated>.trycloudflare.com URL here.
VITE_API_BASE=
